'''Prisoner Cat''' (にゃんこ囚人, Nyanko Shūjin, Prisoner Cat) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[Adult Cat Awakes!|Adult Cat Awakens!]] and [[Infernal Tower]]. He was added in [[Version 4.6 Update|Version 4.6]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Prisoner Cat
|image = E 230.png
|appearance = [[Adult Cat Awakes!]]
[[Infernal Tower/Floor 20|Infernal Tower - Floor 20]]
|money drop = 1,555¢ - 6,142¢
}}

==Enemy==
Prisoner Cat has high health (1,500,000) and high damage (12,000). However, he has a big blind spot and, as a result, cannot hit enemies right in front of him.

==Strategy==
:''See [[Growing Up (Expert)]], [[Growing Up (Insane)]] and [[Infernal Tower/Floor 20|Floor 20]] for their respective stratgies.''

